www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2559399-dungeons-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢！</a></strong>（1）模组的继任者，后者在地牢设计和定制方面更为复杂。</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><h4><strong>需求 / 依赖</strong></h4><p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/gottschcore/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GottschCore</a></p></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><h4><strong>其他模组&nbsp;</strong></h4><div><strong>宝藏2！</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/treasure2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/treasure2</a></div><div><strong>快速梯子</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/fastladder\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/fastladder</a></div><div><strong>金属</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/sgs-metals\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/sgs-metals</a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div>",
